            <ArticleTitle>Diagnosing, treating and managing carcinoid tumours.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>32-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Carcinoid tumours are slow-developing, rare, malignant, hormone-secreting tumours. This article discusses their diagnosis, treatment and symptom management and highlights the need for a multidisciplinary approach to patient care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
